{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Matchstone is a memory match roguelike deck builder focused on combining various strange and magical stones to score big!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1744651664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match similar stones to unlock their powerful effects, but be careful! When stones don't match, you will be a bit closer to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1744651664\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan ahead and use the shop to purchase what you need for victory. Use booster packs to level up stone classes to match your way to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<br>Can you find the source of the stones power?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2979150?t=1744651664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/ae206f88f312751378dc2a3f8efe7b904c7342e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744651664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/003e8d958eeeeef39ada7be74337b9c918eefd7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744651664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/003e8d958eeeeef39ada7be74337b9c918eefd7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744651664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Matchstone is a memory match roguelike deck builder focused on combini